---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import RiverItem from "../../components/RiverItem.astro";
---

<Layout lang="en" title="Destinations Dorado - Massive Trout Fly Fishing, Corrientes" description="Golden Dorado Fly Fishing in Corrientes, Argentina" bodyClass="no-js">
  <section class="sec__hero hero--small hero--dorado">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero__content">
        <h1 class="heading--big text--center">Dorado Fly Fishing Paradise</h1>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec__intro intro_sinback">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-12">
          <h2 class="heading--big text--center intro-title-margin">One of Argentina's Premier Golden Dorado Fisheries</h2>
          <p class="text--grey text--center">
            The Upper Paraná River in Corrientes is one of South America's premier fly-fishing destinations and one of the finest places in the world to pursue Golden Dorado. A powerful river, vast stretches of water, islands, cliffs, beaches, and lush riverbank vegetation create the setting for a truly extraordinary fishing experience.
          </p>
          <p class="text--grey text--center">
            Fishing takes place in a wild environment where native forest, trees, palms, and islands accompany every day on the river. Herons, cormorants, kingfishers, and an incredible variety of birdlife are part of the landscape, while the wildlife of Argentina's northeastern wetlands and forests can be found throughout the riverbanks and surrounding habitats.
          </p>
          <p class="text--grey text--center">
            But there is one undeniable protagonist: the Golden Dorado. Powerful, aggressive, and completely unpredictable, it is one of the most exciting fish to pursue with a fly rod. Explosive strikes, powerful runs, and spectacular jumps can turn a single cast into a moment of pure adrenaline.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec__intro">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-6">
          <img src="/images/03_destinations/dorado/dorado-intro-body.jpeg" alt="Dorado fishing" class="img-responsive" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6">
          <h2 class="dorado-intro-title">A Demanding Fishery, A First-Class Experience</h2>
          <p class="text--grey">
            The Upper Paraná is a demanding fishery that requires experience and constant adaptation. Depending on conditions, we may target Dorado along current seams, backwaters, shorelines, structure, river mouths, and other areas where these powerful predators hunt. Reading the river, choosing the right fly, and presenting it precisely are essential to making the most of every opportunity.
          </p>
          <p class="text--grey">
            Our program is designed to experience this extraordinary fishery with a first-class level of service. The experience includes lodge accommodation, meals, transportation, professional guides, and everything needed to keep your attention where it belongs — on the fishing and the adventure. From the planning process to every day on the river, every detail is carefully considered to provide a personalized and exceptional experience.
          </p>
          <p class="text--grey">
            No two days on the Upper Paraná are exactly alike. River level and clarity, water temperature, wind, and fish activity determine where and how we fish. Our guides constantly adapt the strategy to find the best conditions and maximize the opportunities to encounter the Dorado everyone comes for.
          </p>
          <p class="text--grey">
            Fishing the Upper Paraná is about much more than pursuing a fish. It is about traveling one of South America's great rivers, being surrounded by extraordinary wildlife and lush landscapes, and experiencing one of the most exciting fly-fishing adventures Argentina has to offer.
          </p>
          <p class="text--grey">
            <strong>An extraordinary fishery. First-class service. And the Golden Dorado at the heart of an experience you will not easily forget.</strong>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec__vacation sec__vacation--dorado-dest" id="parallax_dorado_dest">
    <div class="container">
      <br />
      <h2 class="heading_home_best">Upper Paraná River - Corrientes, North of Argentina</h2>
      <p class="text--grey text--center">
        Premier Golden Dorado Fisheries
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <RiverItem
    topPadding={true}
    name="Alto Paraná River"
    subt="Golden Dorado fly fishing in Corrientes"
    image="/images/03_destinations/dorado/dorado_destinations.png"
    details={[
      { label: "Season: ", value: "All year around" },
      { label: "Species: ", value: "Golden Dorado / Pirá Pitá / Pacú" },
      { label: "Main Fishing Areas: ", value: "Corrientes province / Upper Paraná River" },
      { label: "Type of fishing: ", value: "Fly fishing / Sight fishing / Streamers" },
      { label: "Trip Options: ", value: "Full-day / Multi-day" },
    ]}
    paras={[
      "The Upper Paraná River in Corrientes offers one of South America's most exciting fly fishing experiences, combining powerful Golden Dorado, clear water, diverse river structure, and an extraordinary natural setting.",
      "Days on the river are spent from comfortable technical boats, working rocky banks, submerged structure, current seams, deep runs, and shallow sandbars. The fishing is active and demanding, with accurate casting and streamer presentation playing a central role in the pursuit of Golden Dorado.",
      "Back at the lodge, the experience continues with comfortable accommodations, excellent cuisine, and personalized service. Each day is designed to combine outstanding fishing with the comfort and hospitality that make a stay on the Upper Paraná a complete experience.",
    ]}
  />

  <section class="sec__destinations_but">
    <div class="container">
      <a class="btn btn--full btn--oval" href="/booking/" role="button" title="Book your trip">Book your trip</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
